            "review_title": "Review at Bombay Bento Indian",
            "review_text": "Bhutan Travel Consultant\nThimphu, Bhutan3 contributions\n0\nBest Indian Food in HCM Delivery!\nFeb 2021 • Family\nIf you are craving for some Indian food and you do not know any place to go. Contact Bombay Bento for yummylicious Indian food. You don’t need to go to their place. Simply message them via their social app and make your order. The food will be at your door within minutes. \n\nDon’t believe? Grab your phone and order to be sure.\n\nBombay Bento has never let me down whenever I was in HCM or if I am in HCM. \n\nI Love Bombay Bento \n\nYour all time customer,\n\nPravesh \nBhutan\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 27, 2021",
